# Rust conventions

Full context: [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md).

- Use `anyhow::Result` at binary boundaries; use `thiserror` for library
  error enums.
- No `.unwrap()` / `.expect()` in `ailint-core` or `ailint-llm` outside
  `#[cfg(test)]`.
- No `reqwest` or provider SDK imports in `ailint-core`.
- Follow `cargo fmt --all`; fix `cargo clippy -- -D warnings` rather than
  suppressing.
- Prefer `Path` / `PathBuf` over `String` for filesystem paths.
- Every public item in `ailint-core` gets a doc comment describing what
  a caller needs to know, not restating the signature.
